## Configuration

### config/asentric.yaml

- `chain` - Blockchain connection settings
- `source` - Event source configuration (websocket)
- `sink` - Alert destination (console, webhook)
- `debug` - Enable debug logging

### config/registry.yaml

Add contracts to monitor:

```yaml
targets:
  - address: "0x..."
    name: "My Contract"
    abi_path: "abi/mycontract.json"
```

## Writing Rules

Rules implement the `asentric.Rule` interface:

```go
type MyRule struct{}

func (r *MyRule) Name() string { return "my-rule" }
func (r *MyRule) Severity() asentric.Severity { return asentric.SeverityMedium }
func (r *MyRule) Evaluate(ctx asentric.Context) (*asentric.Alert, error) {
    // Your detection logic here
    return nil, nil
}
```

Register rules in `cmd/watcher/main.go`:

```go
engine.RegisterRule(&rules.MyRule{})
```

